DATA

1. SMARD
   Bundesnetzagentur | SMARD.de, https://www.smard.de/, licence CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
   Source of the training data: net load, revised history from 2018-01 to 2026-02-06, fetched from the public API.
   The model weights in submission/model-services/gridload-compact/weights/ are derived from this data.
   Changes were made: aggregation to 15 minute and hourly values, normalisation, training of neural networks.

2. TS-Arena-Archive
   DAG-UPB/TS-Arena-Archive (Hugging Face), licence CC BY 4.0, pinned revision 72c6cb0fe11a7c0349b063c74129ff73a87542cc.
   Used for evaluation only: served contexts, first-published ground truth and the forecasts of the reference models.
   The score files and tables under results/ are computed from it (including scores of the reference models).
   Nothing from it, and no forecast of any other model, enters training, calibration or the released weights.
   Results are self-obtained evaluations on the Archive, not official rankings.

3. TS-Arena model metadata
   assets/models.json holds public model metadata (name, family, size, architecture) served by the TS-Arena dashboard
   API (https://ts-arena.live). It is used only to label the reference models in the evidence tables.

